{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016280/extras/095048603cfb5c675e23d20032d7fc60.avif?t=1770942119\" width=650 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016280/extras/9dc76721a24e804120dc84615fe0f64f.poster.avif?t=1770942119\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016280/extras/9dc76721a24e804120dc84615fe0f64f.webm?t=1770942119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016280/extras/9dc76721a24e804120dc84615fe0f64f.mp4?t=1770942119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After centuries, the popular board game of chess gets a modern update.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The old strategy game of chess has returned, reimagined with new pieces, yet true to its medieval roots. Improve your skills and become the greatest strategist with the features of the game including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reviewing past games with the Game Analysis tool</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer (even with those who don\u2019t have the game)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exporting PGNs of any game for later review</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 levels of bots to play against</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Save/Load to pick up where you left off\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4016280?t=1770942119","backgro